@@ -55,6 +59,11 @@ is a simple terminal emulator.
 .B \-a
 disable alternate screens in terminal
 .TP
+.BI \-A " opacity"
+Set background opacity to a finite number between 0 and 1 (default 0.9).
+Requires a 32-bit visual and a compositor for transparency.
+On other visuals the background stays opaque. Invalid values are rejected.
+.TP
 .BI \-c " class"
 defines the window class (default $TERM).
 .TP
@@ -154,11 +163,32 @@ Reset to default font size.
 .B Ctrl-Shift-y
 Paste from primary selection (middle mouse button).
 .TP
-.B Ctrl-Shift-c
+.B Ctrl-Shift-c, Ctrl-Insert
 Copy the selected text to the clipboard selection.
 .TP
 .B Ctrl-Shift-v
 Paste from the clipboard selection.
+.TP
+.B Ctrl-=, Ctrl-+
+Increase font size.
+.TP
+.B Ctrl--
+Decrease font size.
+.TP
+.B Ctrl-0
+Reset font size.
+.TP
+.B Shift-Insert
+Paste from the primary selection.
+.SH WM DEVELOPMENT
+This profile uses Hack Nerd Font Mono at 11 points, a Noto Color Emoji fallback,
+a blinking block cursor, zero fixed padding and per-pixel window resizing.
+Emoji rendering depends on installed fonts and Xft; complex emoji sequences
+are not guaranteed. Blur is the compositor's responsibility.
+.PP
+Scrollback/reflow is not implemented yet. This checkout is not ready to replace
+the current terminal. Use make test in the parent wm repository; do not install
+or start the terminal during this development phase.
 .SH CUSTOMIZATION
 .B st
 can be customized by creating a custom config.h and (re)compiling the source
